From 57017ef73047245df98bf7f03aa840042b6a0d74 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: arealjim <6187715+arealjim@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 12:48:57 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 01/21] steam-frame client: run on the Steam Frame against a
 remote OXRSys runtime

- xrCreateInstance: retry with OpenXR 1.0 when the runtime rejects 1.1 (SteamVR on the Frame)
- FRAME_CLIENT_SERVER=<ip>: unicast DiscoveryRequest for networks that drop the broadcast beacon
- keep sending head tracking while the runtime hides the session (server liveness watchdog is 3 s)
- punch the video return path from the video socket (stateful firewalls / NAT)
- FRAME_CLIENT_DECODER / FRAME_CLIENT_THREADS, decoder reopened at the announced encoded size
  (hevc_v4l2m2m needs it), decode timing stats, FRAME_CLIENT_DUMP_DECODED one-shot frame dump

