+        // check that could not fail. Match each newly decoded frame's pose here too, without
+        // copying pixels or presenting, so the hit/miss counters measure the pipeline either way.
+        // Cost on wake: the first rendered frame's pose was taken here, so it falls back to the
+        // newest pose once, the same fallback startup uses.
